title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/workspace:goto
catalog: GUI command
target: workspace:goto
summary: Move both panels to workspace number N

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``1`` → ``workspace:goto 1``
* ``2`` → ``workspace:goto 2``
* ``3`` → ``workspace:goto 3``
* ``4`` → ``workspace:goto 4``
* ``5`` → ``workspace:goto 5``
* ``6`` → ``workspace:goto 6``
* ``7`` → ``workspace:goto 7``
* ``8`` → ``workspace:goto 8``
* ``9`` → ``workspace:goto 9``
